''Were you looking for [[Flamethrower Cameraman]]?''
== Overview ==
The Flamethrower Toilet can stun units with its flamethrower mouth. Once a unit has been stunned, it will be on fire which will constantly stun it until the fire is over. If a unit on fire gets unstuned by [[Camera Repair Drone]] or [[Medic Cameraman]], it will get stunned again.
