== Strategy ==
High DPS units are recommended for this toilet, like [[Mech Cameraman|Mech Cameraman,]] [[Laser Cameraman Car|Titan Speakerman,]] etc. [[Secret Agent]] could be useful if it gets too far from your main defense.

== Trivia ==
* A similar toilet with the same ability is the [[Toxic Skull Toilet|Toxic Skull Toilet]], except that he uses acid instead of fire.
* This toilet is based on the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Giant_Blind_Flamethrower_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Giant Blind Flamethrower Skibidi Toilet].
